(property "Description" "TI TPS2553 auto-retry current-limited switch. Feeds only panel J32.1, the STOP sensing/base-drive chain and the external button station; K1 coil power is supplied separately through Q50. R245 = 210k sets 110-150 mA so a loom or station short cannot pull down the isolated +5 V rail. EN tied to IN; FAULT unused." (at 50.8 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
